## System Architecture

```mermaid
graph TD
    User --> CLI[CLI: run.py]
    CLI --> Orchestrator

    Orchestrator --> Guardrails
    Orchestrator --> Translator
    Orchestrator --> Retriever
    Retriever --> Qdrant[(Qdrant)]
    Orchestrator --> LLMRouter
    LLMRouter --> Providers[Provider Clients]
    Orchestrator --> Evaluator

    Evaluator -->|pass| CLI
    Evaluator -->|retry/fallback| Orchestrator

